{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "End-to-end routing/quality golden set.  Every case drives a real conversation through the HTTP API and checks the assistant metadata and conversation state against the expected outcome.  A model or prompt change must not regress these cases (the release quality gate). Phase 19.3 expands coverage to >=25 cases spanning multi-turn context, CJK/English variants, prompt-injection variants, cross-customer non-disclosure, and canary-safe routing.",
